      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Solve the coefficient equations",
      "body": "<p>Clear fractions if needed. Multiply one equation so subtracting the two removes one unknown.</p>",
      "recap": "Elimination combines two equations to remove a variable.",
      "pitfall": "When multiplying an equation, multiply every term.",
